137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (These study guides are designed to help participants better understand their assigned challenges, explore the relevant scientific concepts, and familiarise themselves with the resources and knowledge required to develop innovative solutions. They aim to make complex topics more accessible and provide participants with a clear starting point for their research and project development.)
/Pg 12 0 R
